 chunks←readChunks result;row_count;_vector;_column_type;chunk;column;_data_chunk;r;column_count;column_types;column_ltypes;col;data;chunk_data

 _data_chunk←api.duckdb_fetch_chunk ⊂result
 :If 0=_data_chunk
     chunks←(0 0⍴⊂⍬)(0⍴⍬)
     →0
 :EndIf
 column_count←api.duckdb_data_chunk_get_column_count _data_chunk
 column_types←column_count⍴0
 column_ltypes←column_count⍴0
 data←⍬
 chunk←0

 :While 0≠_data_chunk
     row_count←api.duckdb_data_chunk_get_size _data_chunk
     chunk_data←column_count⍴⊂⍬
     :For column :In ⍳column_count
         _vector←api.duckdb_data_chunk_get_vector _data_chunk column
         :If chunk=0
             _column_type←api.duckdb_vector_get_column_type _vector
             column_ltypes[column]←_column_type
             column_types[column]←api.duckdb_get_type_id _column_type
         :Else
             _column_type←column⊃column_ltypes
         :EndIf
         col←readVector _vector _column_type row_count
         chunk_data[column]←⊂col
     :EndFor
     data,←⊂chunk_data
     r←api.duckdb_destroy_data_chunk _data_chunk
     chunk+←1
     _data_chunk←api.duckdb_fetch_chunk ⊂result
 :EndWhile

 {}api.duckdb_destroy_logical_type¨column_ltypes
 data←↑data
 chunks←(data column_types)
⍝ KSL 2.0.0
